      "end": 1877,
      "end_line": 20,
      "line": 20,
      "start": 1382
    },
    "text": "The operator asked that skill, agent and tool plugins be as widely compatible as possible, with Claude Code plugins, skills and agents, MCP servers, `AGENTS.md`-style conventions and other agent ecosystems, rather than a Delphi-only format. This spec fixes, for each external format, **what Delphi adopts as-is, what it extends, and what it deliberately does not do**, and defines the import, export and capability model that keeps a third-party skill, agent or tool within the host's authority."
  }
